!.env.example

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo

# Docs
*.md
!README.md

# Test artifacts
coverage/
__tests__/
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx

# Misc
.turbo
